, "end": 14, "text": ".3 Health Ch ."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d03", "start": 15, "end": 243, "text": ".4 PBS Kids WFOR-TV 4 .1 CBS .2 Start .3 Dabl .4 Fave .5 Catchy WTVJ 6 .1 NBC .2 Cozi .3 AmCrimes .4 Oxygen WSVN 7 .1 Fox .2 365BLK → ABC .3 Defy WGEN-TV 8 .1 Estrella TV .2/.4 LC .3 HQ .5 Nosey .6 Confess WPLG 10 .1 ABC → Ind ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d03", "start": 244, "end": 286, "text": ".2 MeTV .3 H & I WURH-CD 13 .1 Health Ch ."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d03", "start": 287, "end": 412, "text": "WLRN-TV 17 .1 PBS WSBS-TV 22 .1 Mega TV .2 CLAFE WLTV-DT 23 .1 UNI .2 Crime .3 Mystery .5 NV .6 LC WBFS-TV 33 .1 CW .2 Movies"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 0, "end": 80, "text": "Cleveland television station to begin broadcasting newscasts in high-definition."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 81, "end": 208, "text": "At present, all locally produced portions of the station's newscasts, including live remote field footage, are presented in HD."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 209, "end": 341, "text": "It was also around this time that channel 5 introduced the modified version of the classic \"Circle 5\" logo that was used until 2016."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 342, "end": 400, "text": "Sister station WPTV also uses the classic \"Circle 5\" logo."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 401, "end": 513, "text": "On May 21, 2009, Ted Henry retired as the primary news anchor at channel 5, after holding the post for 33 years."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0396-8dc82e76946c:d04", "start": 514, "end": 587, "text": "Henry is the longest serving news anchor in 